Debug mode highlights each frontmatter field on its own and leaves a blank line between fields unhighlighted.
== args
--debug
input/frontmatter-empty-line.md
== file input/frontmatter-empty-line.md
---
title: Guide

owner: docs
---

Body text.
== stdout
---
\x1b[32mtitle: Guide\x1b[0m

\x1b[32mowner: docs\x1b[0m
---

